Dita takaina nunak, ashí tikich aents aidaush, minak eme anenjus diigtinme tusag aaninawai, nuninak nijayinish sentan wegkagman jukiag, chicham umiktajum tibau aidaun agak, kuntujinish dutiksag jigkamá yujainawai. Aantsag nugkuagbauji weniya nuwish sasamjuk detujag nugkujag yujainawai.
Tujash yaunchuk najanin agma imatiksag najanatnume tusajum inagtajum, machikish awagtukigpajum. Ditak daki asag mujá shiyakaja kuntin maa apeaku Tuke Pujuu emematmi tusag imatuinawai.
