Tama Moisés Tuke Pujuun ayaak: “¡Chah, Tuke Pujuuwah! Wika shiig jintiaja chichamainchau dekapnujai, junak yaunchuk nagkamsan, yamai ame augtakminish nunisnuk chichajai”, tau.
Israel aents aidaun Apajuíji, Tuke Pujuuwah, ametme iina apuji pegkegmamek, tuja ametme ejajatkam kuitamkagtaumek.
Nunik siete nantu taka nuigtu diecisiete tsawan wegai, muja Araratnum arca patamiuwai.
Israel aents aidaunak waji ajakaitkuish wi dita nugken susauwaitag nuwi atakesh tegai ajapashtinun ajakmawagtatjai”, tusa Tuke Pujuu tawai, tiuwai Amós.
Apajuíyai aents pimpikiunash senchimtika wajiu emauwa duka, tuja aents kakakchaunash senchijin ikauntinai.
Akikmamu
Dekas tajime: Ju nugka juwi akiinaidauk Juan Yamijatna nuna nagkaesauk atsawai, tujash Apajuí inamtainig aents dekas imanchauchia nuuwai Juagkan nagkaesauk.
“ ‘Israel aents aidauwah, yama nagkamchak mina emematjaku waitai pegkejam aakmakbau Silónum aajakua nuwi wetajum, nunikjum diistajum wisha nunú jeganash atumi tudaujinish itugkauwaitja nunú.
Tusa takugmin wi ayaakun: ‘Minak makichik aentskesh kasagtumaitsui. Tujash atum minak kasagtagme.’ Nuniayaitkujum: ‘¿Iish waji aminush kasamkaji?’ tusajum ininjume. ¡Atumek minak atum takasa jukimunmaya diezmo, nuigtu anentag sujusta tibau aina nunú kasagtagme!
ame awi weme mina chichameg etsegbaun antukag shiig dekaawag, pegkegchaun takainak suwenum wajukmaina numamtuk wajaidau asag, iwanchin inatai yujá nunak idayinak, dekas pegkeja nuna takainak, tsawai wekaemaina numamtuk wajainak Apajuin umigkatnume. Nuna nuninak mina dekaskeapi tujutuinak, ditá tudaujinash tsagkugnagtinme, nunikag Apajuí pegkemtikbau aidau jukiagtina nuna ditashkam jukiagtinme’, tujutmayi.
Tusa Apajuí chichaak: “Yamai atum shiig antuktajum; ashí ajak juju nugkanmaya nejen aina nunak, numi neje yujutai aina nujai, atum yuwatnun umigkajime.
Yaunchuk nagkamsa jiikbau aidau
